#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. いまは校章が浮かんでいるだけだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"Right now, it's just showing the school crest.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. これも、壊したら…罰があるのかもな…
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "If I break it...Monokuma might come and punish *me*."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんなカメラで…
#. 不二咲さんが殺されるところも見てたのか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Did the mastermind sit there and watch what happened\n"
"to Chihiro...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>自販機だ…お金は取らないみたいだ。
#. 飲み放題って事か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This vending machine doesn't seem to take any money.\n"
"So I guess we can drink as much as we want...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…なくなったらモノクマが
#. 補充してるんだろうか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I wonder if Monokuma comes and refills it when it runs\n"
"out of stuff.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここ、購買部みたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Yup, this is definitely the school store.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>超一流の高校でも…
#. こういう施設があるんだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So even such a top-notch high school still has basic\n"
"stuff like this.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0009 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0010 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
